      "caveats": null,
      "what": "The study introduces the CO2 Emission Spatial Index (CESI), which combines MODIS and VIIRS-DNB satellite data to map urban carbon emissions across Europe from 2012 to 2021. Using a zonal classification approach, the model achieved spatial estimation accuracies with R² values exceeding 0.96. The research also introduces the PGL index, a normalized indicator combining population, GDP, and land use, to analyze imbalances in emission coordination across different European countries.",
